itialDelaySeconds`（如 8s）和 `timeoutSeconds`（如 1s）。应用正常业务请求延迟极低，但在启动初期（可能尚未度过 initialDelay）或发生短暂 GC 停顿（未反映在日志平均耗时中）时，响应时间极有可能瞬间超过 1s，从而触发 Kubelet 的强制终止行为。\n\n**未确认的补充细节：**\n缺少确切的单次 Trace ID 或监控采样点直接记录到某一次 `/health` 探测的响应时间超过 1s（通常业务日志和追踪不记录内部探针请求），但这并不影响上述基于排除法得出的确定性结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 13.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 767.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc: 767.3s (Evidence 754.4s, RCA 12.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 805.159, "metrics": {"run_id": "f95ba697d4014711", "mttr": {"value": "13.4m", "seconds": 805.1604449748993, "pass": false, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "56%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数",